#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Patterns Travel is an adventurous and versatile WordPress theme designed for travel agencies, tour operators, travel bloggers, and adventure enthusiasts. Built with WordPress Full Site Editing (FSE), this theme enables seamless customization of headers, footers, templates, and global styles directly within the WordPress Site Editor. The theme includes pre-designed patterns and layouts tailored for showcasing featured sections, about sections, travel packages, destinations, categories, customer testimonials, blogs, about, contact and services pages. Its responsive design ensures your website looks captivating and professional across all devices, offering an inspiring platform to highlight your travel services and adventures."
msgstr ""

